**Entry routing:**
- Never logged in + watch → Pain → Promise → permissions → Connecting → **post-auth scan** (skeleton + `#onbAnalyzeOverlay` on schedule) → Schedule.
- Never logged in + non-watch → same path → `#wrongUrlFallAnim` after scan (`authFlowKind=new-wrong-url` uses `#onboardingAnalyzing` mock chrome during scan).
- Logged in + non-watch → `#wrongUrlFallAnim` (Figma **533:9884**). Not `#wrongUrlOverlay` / last-video snapshot.
- **Logout** → clears tokens + `onboardingComplete` + `calendarScanned` → Pain → Promise → … (prefs/history kept remotely). Soft logout no longer jumps to Connecting.
- **Session expired / refresh revoked** → silent Google re-auth; if that fails → `showReturningConnecting()` (Connecting sheet, skips Pain/Promise). Keeps `onboardingComplete`.
- Returning logged out + watch (still `onboardingComplete`) → Connecting → OAuth → Schedule (skip Analyzing UI; silent prefs if needed). Non-watch → `newUserWrongUrl`.

**Flags (`chrome.storage.local`):** `onboardingComplete` (cleared on logout so Pain/Promise restarts; kept across session-expiry reconnect; cleared on full erase), `calendarScanned` (wipe on any logout / session-expiry). Migration: session → complete; `user_slot_preferences.selected_days` → scanned. `authFlowKind`: `new` | `new-wrong-url` | `returning`.

**Preview:** serve `Watch Later Extension/` on `:8321`. **`chrome.html`** or **`popup#preview=1`** (hash form when static `serve` strips `?preview=1` on `.html`). `&schedule=1` jumps straight to schedule with a fresh random sample each load. `&multi=1` for multi-session. `#preview=1&auth=promise` opens Promise directly. `#preview=1&wrongurl=1` = first-time Wrong URL onboarding. `#preview=1&auth=permissions|analyzing|connecting|denied|…`. `#preview=1&returning=1` for returning Connecting.

v2 = same OAuth, scheduling, history, analytics (referral UI removed — see the profile menu section). UI surface is `popup.html` + `style.css` + modal markup.

