Screens in `#onboarding`, shown by `showOnboarding()` / `showOnboarding({ wrongUrl: true })`. Index: 0 Pain → 1 Promise → 2 Permissions → 3 Analyzing (post-OAuth). Always restarts at Pain when opened logged out.

| Screen | Figma / id | Role |
|--------|------------|------|
| Pain | `onboardingPain` (`531:958`) | Pain hook; pink Failed-Gradient BG; frame radius 0; Heading 26/32; `#onbModal` + cards radius 16; chip +1°; stamp **#fa463d**; modal entry every visit; **2-dot ticker**; catalog cards |
