Shared shell: 340×486 (`--frame-w` / `--frame-h`). Bottom sheets / modals: padding **12 all sides**, gap **16** (`--space-3` / `--space-4`); inset 8 from frame. No drop shadow on modal panels. Auth dim over schedule: hardcoded CSS `linear-gradient(#282828→#FFFFFF @ 50% opacity)` + `blur(1px)` — do not use a PNG export. **`--btn-h: 40px`** `.onb-btn`. Preview (`?preview=1`): `html:has(body.wl-preview)` unlocks the 340px `html` lock so the frame is grid-centered.

